WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.734
Quick: what’s “bench” in Spanish?

00:02.600 --> 00:03.859
Word lists taught you “apple.”

00:04.050 --> 00:06.299
But outside? You still can't name the bench.

00:06.800 --> 00:07.753
Meet Linguini.

00:07.950 --> 00:09.348
Learn the language of your day.

00:10.000 --> 00:11.078
Snap the café.

00:11.300 --> 00:12.062
The street.

00:12.350 --> 00:13.477
The view from the bridge.

00:14.600 --> 00:17.056
Linguini finds the words inside your photo,

00:17.500 --> 00:18.631
articles attached.

00:18.800 --> 00:20.714
Keep what's useful. Drop the rest.

00:21.250 --> 00:21.832
Hear it,

00:23.050 --> 00:24.359
then say it, out loud.

00:25.550 --> 00:26.404
Play I-Spy.

00:26.500 --> 00:27.724
Crack Linguini's clue,

00:28.100 --> 00:29.618
then describe something back.

00:31.100 --> 00:32.628
Finish with a journal page.

00:32.750 --> 00:35.332
Your new words, pinned to a day you actually lived.

00:36.000 --> 00:37.054
A few minutes a day.

00:37.200 --> 00:38.090
Keep your streak.

00:38.300 --> 00:39.299
Pick your pasta.

00:40.420 --> 00:41.033
Photo.

00:41.420 --> 00:42.046
Words.

00:42.420 --> 00:42.962
Play.

00:43.420 --> 00:44.005
Journal.

00:44.800 --> 00:45.517
Linguini.

00:45.550 --> 00:46.824
The world is your lesson.

00:46.900 --> 00:48.498
Try a free mini session today.
